## 5. User Flow Diagrams

### Flow 1: Cart Checkout Flow
```
Product Catalog
    ↓ (Click "Add to Cart")
Add to Cart Modal (Select Quantity)
    ↓ (Click "View Cart")
Shopping Cart Page (Review items, adjust quantities)
    ↓ (Click "Proceed to Checkout")
Checkout Page (Fill customer form + payment method)
    ↓ (Click "Place Order")
Success Message → Redirect to Catalog
```

### Flow 2: Direct Order Flow
```
Product Catalog
    ↓ (Click "View Details")
Product Details Page (Full specs + Direct order form)
    ↓ (Fill form + select quantity)
Submit Order
    ↓
Success Message → Redirect to Catalog
```

