### 3. Technical Implementation Details

#### Cart Context (Global State)
```javascript
// CartContext should provide:
- cart: [] // Array of cart items
- addToCart(product, quantity)
- removeFromCart(productId)
- updateQuantity(productId, newQuantity)
- clearCart()
- getCartTotal()
- getCartCount()
```

#### localStorage Implementation
- Save cart to localStorage on every cart update
- Load cart from localStorage on app mount
- Key: "homeAutomationCart"
- Format: JSON string of cart array

#### Order Data Logging
When an order is submitted (either flow), log to console:
```javascript
console.log("=== ORDER SUBMITTED ===");
console.log(JSON.stringify(orderData, null, 2));
```
Use order data formats specified in PRD Section 3.2

#### Routing
```javascript
<Route path="/" element={<ProductCatalog />} />
<Route path="/products" element={<ProductCatalog />} />
<Route path="/product/:id" element={<ProductDetails />} />
<Route path="/cart" element={<ShoppingCart />} />
<Route path="/checkout" element={<Checkout />} />
```

