- Primary (buttons, links): Blue - `bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700`
- Secondary (view details, success): Green - `bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-700`
- Danger (remove, delete): Red - `bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700`
- Text: Gray - `text-gray-800`, `text-gray-600`
- Background: `bg-gray-50` for pages, `bg-white` for cards

**Component Styles**:
