### 5. Validation & Error Handling

**Form Validation**:
- Required fields: Show red border and error message if empty on submit
- Phone: Basic validation (10+ digits)
- Email: Standard email format validation
- Address: Minimum 10 characters
- Show error messages below fields in red text

**Cart Validation**:
- Cannot checkout with empty cart
- Quantity cannot be less than 1
- Quantity cannot exceed stock (optional check)

**Modal Behavior**:
- Prevent body scroll when modal open
- Close on ESC key
- Close on outside click
- Close on any action button

